@host = http://localhost:5080

### Liste des morceaux
GET {{host}}/api/songs
Accept: application/json

### Document OpenAPI
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Créer un morceau
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/songs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Nocturne en ré mineur", "artist": "SongVault Band", "description": "Ballade piano-voix" }

### Relire le morceau créé
GET {{host}}/api/songs/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Titre manquant → 400 (validation [ApiController])
POST {{host}}/api/songs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "artist": "Sans titre" }

### Id inconnu → 404
GET {{host}}/api/songs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Liste paginée
GET {{host}}/api/songs?page=1&pageSize=2

### pageSize hors bornes → 400
GET {{host}}/api/songs?pageSize=500

### Modifier le morceau créé plus haut → 204
PUT {{host}}/api/songs/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Nocturne en ré mineur (arrangement)", "artist": "SongVault Band", "description": "Version cordes" }

### Supprimer → 204 (un second appel → 404)
DELETE {{host}}/api/songs/{{create.response.body.$.id}}





### Créer un morceau pour les versions
# @name song
POST {{host}}/api/songs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Lumière froide", "artist": "SongVault Band" }

### Version (à exécuter 3 fois → numéros 1, 2, 3)
# @name version
POST {{host}}/api/songs/{{song.response.body.$.id}}/versions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Maquette guitare-voix", "status": "Demo", "notes": "Capo 2" }

### Lister les versions
GET {{host}}/api/songs/{{song.response.body.$.id}}/versions

### Détail
GET {{host}}/api/songs/{{song.response.body.$.id}}/versions/{{version.response.body.$.id}}

### Modifier le statut → 204
PUT {{host}}/api/songs/{{song.response.body.$.id}}/versions/{{version.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Maquette guitare-voix", "status": "Rehearsal", "notes": "Capo 2, tempo 92" }

### Statut inconnu → 400
POST {{host}}/api/songs/{{song.response.body.$.id}}/versions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "X", "status": "Mastering" }

### Politique de fichiers
GET {{host}}/api/files/policy